{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"“眼前的相处”和“此刻能这样靠近就已经很好”是在概括当下的亲近感与满足感，没有补出具体人物关系、场景或真实动作。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"被亲近打动、舍不得这一刻过去以及情绪短暂外露后又收敛，都能从B4和B5的主观体验中找到依据，没有新增具体对白或外部事件。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"links\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"前段尚未准备好面对在意之事带来的变化，能解释他暂时停留在当下、不急于往前推进。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"前段对可能发生的变化仍有顾虑，能解释他被亲近打动后虽有心意外露的倾向，却最终又收住。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"两条线交代了他先安于当下的亲近，再被触动、舍不得这一刻并短暂想外露心意却又收敛的过程，不看珠子也能理解。\",\n  \"progress\": \"是\",\n  \"progress_why\": \"本段以眼前的亲近作为新的触发，并让S01已经确立的顾虑解释后续收敛，形成了从安于当下到短暂外露又退回克制的推进，而非单纯重复背景理由。\",\n  \"unexplained\": [],\n  \"wordy\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c100f9e7-a3a9-49b7-b8d0-da003d917550", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T060259306844Z", "elapsed_seconds": 216.25, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T06:06:35.564963+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "f23a9a841e70cb56fdfaca805b694de0146a3656719351673118ec6180a66dd6", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "